        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 2,
      "caption": "I tried to unlock his bridegroom clasp and wriggle free, when a slight scratch and a fling of the quilt showed the tomahawk sleeping by his side.",
      "caption_zone": "top_left",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/generated_frames/frame_002.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/lettered_frames/frame_002.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 3,
      "caption": "By dint of much wriggling and expostulation I roused him; he shook himself like a Newfoundland dog and sat up, while I lay quietly eyeing him with no serious misgivings, bent on narrowly observing so curious a creature.",
      "caption_zone": "bottom_center",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/generated_frames/frame_003.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/lettered_frames/frame_003.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 4,
      "caption": "He jumped out and, by signs and sounds, gave me to understand he would dress first and then leave me to dress, which I took for a very civilized overture and let him proceed.",
      "caption_zone": "top_right",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/generated_frames/frame_004.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/lettered_frames/frame_004.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 5,
      "caption": "I saw him commence at top with a very tall beaver hat, then crush himself\u2014boots in hand and hat on\u2014under the bed, and at last emerge dented, creaking and limping about the room.",
      "caption_zone": "bottom_left",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/generated_frames/frame_005.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/lettered_frames/frame_005.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 6,
      "caption": "Seeing the window bare and his indecorous figure, I begged him to accelerate his toilet and get into his pantaloons, which he did.",
      "caption_zone": "top_center",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/generated_frames/frame_006.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/lettered_frames/frame_006.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 7,
      "caption": "To my amazement he washed only chest, arms, and hands, then lathered his face and, unsheathing the harpoon head, fell to harpooning his cheeks before marching out wrapped in his pilot monkey jacket, sporting the weapon like a marshal\u2019s baton.",
      "caption_zone": "bottom_right",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_auto/chapter_004/generated_frames/frame_007.png",
